==Equipment Rebalancing Updated==
We'd like to thank you for all of the feedback since first releasing the Equipment Rebalancing proposal on January 21st. There was a lot of it! We've collated some of the notable bits in the table below. We've also edited the blog with any content changes.

We're confident that the changes in this blog, and previous iterations, have reached the right balance between reacting to addressable feedback and staying true to our reasons for this update. '''That means the changes will be made live in this week's game update on 10th February.''' We'll be closely monitoring the impact of the changes as well as your ongoing feedback. We'll be well-placed to react quickly, and will communicate any required changes in advance.

